# The MIR optimizer (DCE — eliminate_dead_code in mir.tg) and the MIR
# verifier (verify_mir / verify_function_v2 in mir.tg) live in the mir
# module; the side-effect retention rule covers REACHABLE code only —
# unreachable blocks are removed regardless of their contents.
